  "tables": [],
  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Call this endpoint to delete a message. After successfully deleting the message, its `messageIdentifier` no longer exists.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "To avoid errors, don’t use the `messageIdentifier` of deleted messages in `RealtimeResponseBody` when your server replies to the `Get Retention Message` endpoint.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/RealtimeResponseBody"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Note**\n>\n> This endpoint isn’t idempotent. If the system doesn’t find the message, this endpoint throws an error.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "To delete an image associated with a message, call `Delete-Image` after you delete the message.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Delete-Image"
          ]
        }
      ],
